Implemented M3–M5 for Margin. The side panel captures selections, pages, PDFs, YouTube captions, images, and pasted notes. Generated cards show routing reasons and can be edited, tagged, and deduplicated before saving.

Added FSRS review with on-device typed-answer grading, cloze cards, keyboard shortcuts, and per-deck due counts. Options now include privacy and inference controls, queue retries, deck management, stats, and TSV and `.apkg` exports. Both export formats imported successfully into Anki’s backend.

Build and typecheck passed, along with 30 unit tests and 5 Playwright tests. Browser verification used demo inference and local fixtures. Live Gemini inference and YouTube caption fetching remain unverified.
